# direnv entry point for the Aztec AVM Runtime.
#
# `direnv allow` once; thereafter every shell under this tree gets the same
# toolchain the CI checks use — node 24, yarn 4, wasi-sdk 33, wasmtime,
# binaryen, wabt, cmake, ninja, clang 20 — with WASI_SDK_PATH,
# WASI_SDK_PREFIX and the LD_LIBRARY_PATH the prebuilt NAPI AVM needs already
# exported. Nothing in this repo is expected to work against a host toolchain.
#
# The sibling fork (../aztec-packages) has its own .envrc and its own shell;
# the two are deliberately separate because a flake input pointing at a private
# repo would need authentication.

watch_file flake.nix
watch_file flake.lock
watch_file nix/wasi-sdk.nix

use flake
